Package: introToR
Type: Package
Title: Introduction To R
Version: 4.0.0
Author: Ji-Dung Luo, Matt Paul, Wei Wang, Doug Barrows and Thomas Carroll.
Maintainer: Thomas Carroll <tc.infomatics@gmail.com>
Description: Dependency + system-requirements manifest for the Introduction to R
    course. The course content lives under docs/ (notebooks/, exercises/,
    descriptions/, data/, imgs/) and is rendered by the compileCourses engine;
    this thin package exists only to declare the packages the course needs so
    they can be installed and listed on the front page.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Depends: methods, rio
Suggests: formatR
SystemRequirements: R, RStudio
biocViews: Training
